{"3368880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pickscover 2", "steam_appid": 3368880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plunged into a forgotten world overrun with chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must make this world your own by using it's resources to return balance to it's inhabitants. Over time, collect stronger weapons and armour by fighting off enemies and looting chests, while also shaping the world to your need using pickaxes and axes. Once you are ready, summon and defeat the many bosses of darkness and light to restore order to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368880/extras/fbe06a0b249359ea672bcc6cf5084c50.poster.avif?t=1774002852\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368880/extras/fbe06a0b249359ea672bcc6cf5084c50.webm?t=1774002852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368880/extras/fbe06a0b249359ea672bcc6cf5084c50.mp4?t=1774002852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fend off Tons of Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each with their own unique weapons and abilities. Slay them to gain their valuable materials and XP for levelling up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you level up, use your skill points on an extensive skill tree, each tree with it's own stat-specific upgrades and abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368880/extras/58b8b76af34cbd9e05705607fed7c254.poster.avif?t=1774002852\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368880/extras/58b8b76af34cbd9e05705607fed7c254.webm?t=1774002852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368880/extras/58b8b76af34cbd9e05705607fed7c254.mp4?t=1774002852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Utilize different combinations of Weapons and Armour</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip tons of Swords, Bows, Spells, Helmets, Chestplates, Rings, and much more during your journey! Gain special bonus stats for every piece of equipment to use when fighting enemies and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368880/extras/77c297400489cd7c15f1f9558456fbd2.poster.avif?t=1774002852\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368880/extras/77c297400489cd7c15f1f9558456fbd2.webm?t=1774002852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368880/extras/77c297400489cd7c15f1f9558456fbd2.mp4?t=1774002852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Randomly Generated World for you to Shape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover tons of unique structures scattered across the world, from ruins to towers, dungeons to catacombs, each with their own share of enemies and loot. All completely randomly generated with each world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368880/extras/ee273a53561fd1f9752626791dc7d487.poster.avif?t=1774002852\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368880/extras/ee273a53561fd1f9752626791dc7d487.webm?t=1774002852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368880/extras/ee273a53561fd1f9752626791dc7d487.mp4?t=1774002852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plunged into a forgotten world overrun with chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must make this world your own by using it's resources to return balance to it's inhabitants. Over time, collect stronger weapons and armour by fighting off enemies and looting chests, while also shaping the world to your need using pickaxes and axes. Once you are ready, summon and defeat the many bosses of darkness and light to restore order to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368880/extras/fbe06a0b249359ea672bcc6cf5084c50.poster.avif?t=1774002852\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368880/extras/fbe06a0b249359ea672bcc6cf5084c50.webm?t=1774002852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368880/extras/fbe06a0b249359ea672bcc6cf5084c50.mp4?t=1774002852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fend off Tons of Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each with their own unique weapons and abilities. Slay them to gain their valuable materials and XP for levelling up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you level up, use your skill points on an extensive skill tree, each tree with it's own stat-specific upgrades and abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368880/extras/58b8b76af34cbd9e05705607fed7c254.poster.avif?t=1774002852\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"